      "control_name": "No Latent Public Bucket Listing",
      "control_description": "S3 bucket has a policy or ACL that would allow public listing if the public access block were removed. The public access block is currently the only control preventing directory enumeration. This is a latent vulnerability — one configuration change away from exposing all object keys.\n",
